        <characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">3+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile></profiles>
  <rules><rule id="rule-20150" name="Eye of the Ancestors" hidden="false"><description>Whenever an enemy destroys one of your units or slays a model with the character unit subtype in a challenge, place a Grudge token next to it: up to 3 markers per enemy unit.

Your Leagues of Votann units gain stacking bonuses depending on how many tokens the target enemy unit has:
1- LoV units gain Stubborn when engaged with an enemy unit with a token.
2- LoV units gain Hatred against an enemy unit with 2 tokens.
3- LoV units gain Preferred Enemy against an enemy unit with 3 tokens.

In addition, characters with this rule cannot refuse challenges. If an enemy issues a challenge, a character model with this rule must accept the challenge.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20151" name="Void Armour" hidden="false"><description>Models with this rule automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, vehicles with this rule count as having Extra Armour.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20152" name="Independent Character" hidden="false"><description>This model is an Independent Character.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20153" name="Grim Efficiency" hidden="false"><description>After deploying but before rolling to seize the initiative, as long as you have a model with this rule in your army, place a single Grudge Token on an enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20154" name="Steady Advance" hidden="false"><description>A model/unit entirely composed of models with this rule do not count as having moved while in the shooting phase. Whenever a unit with this rule declares to "Run" in the shooting phase, always move 3".</description></rule></rules>
  <infoLinks>
    </infoLinks>
