      <rules><rule id="rule-20201" name="Steady Advance" hidden="false"><description>A model/unit entirely composed of models with this rule do not count as having moved while in the shooting phase. Whenever a unit with this rule declares to "Run" in the shooting phase, always move 3".</description></rule><rule id="rule-20202" name="Companion" hidden="false"><description>Models with this rule are treated as markers and are not targetable in any way. Models with this rule do not block line of sight and other models may move over and through models with this rule. When the attached character and their unit moves, place these models as close as possible to the attached character. When the attached character is slain, remove these models with this rule. Models with this rule may make attacks in the shooting/combat phase, in which case they can target any eligible models that their attached character can target. Models with this rule never gain the benefits for assaulting.</description></rule></rules>
