        <characteristic name="S" typeId="da036dbb-32c2-430a-9dd5-aa74e0c4f74b">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="T" typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="W" typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-afc1-b474d8d2b7a8">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="I" typeId="a558b3ef-04d0-440e-a312-bac3255bf592">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="A" typeId="5dff3e7c-e024-4030-a71d-03195ec06ea7">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea">8</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">4+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile></profiles>
      <rules><rule id="rule-20203" name="Eye of the Ancestors" hidden="false"><description>Whenever an enemy destroys one of your units or slays a model with the character unit subtype in a challenge, place a Grudge token next to it: up to 3 markers per enemy unit.

Your Leagues of Votann units gain stacking bonuses depending on how many tokens the target enemy unit has:
1- LoV units gain Stubborn when engaged with an enemy unit with a token.
2- LoV units gain Hatred against an enemy unit with 2 tokens.
3- LoV units gain Preferred Enemy against an enemy unit with 3 tokens.

In addition, characters with this rule cannot refuse challenges. If an enemy issues a challenge, a character model with this rule must accept the challenge.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20204" name="Void Armour" hidden="false"><description>Models with this rule automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, vehicles with this rule count as having Extra Armour.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20205" name="Independent Character" hidden="false"><description>This model is an Independent Character.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20206" name="Brôkhyr's Guild" hidden="false"><description>In your shooting phase, instead of firing weapons, a character with this rule can repair a vehicle either in base contact or that they are embarked upon. To repair, roll a D6 and add +1 for each E-Cog in the unit. On a 5+, either restore a hull point or remove a Weapon Destroyed or Immobilised result from that vehicle. If this unit contains an Ironkin Assistant, you can pick two different effects on a successful repair roll, but not 2 of the same.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20207" name="Steady Advance" hidden="false"><description>A model/unit entirely composed of models with this rule do not count as having moved while in the shooting phase. Whenever a unit with this rule declares to "Run" in the shooting phase, always move 3".</description></rule></rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <entryLinks>
        
        <infoLink id="il-20219" name="Relic" hidden="false" targetId="grp-20147" type="selectionEntryGroup" />
      <entryLink id="il-20218" name="Pan Spectral Scanner" hidden="false" targetId="eq-20024" type="selectionEntry"><constraints><constraint id="c-mand-6-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="c-mand-6-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></entryLink><entryLink id="el-60007" name="Graviton Hammer" hidden="false" targetId="wpn-gravham-ironmaster" type="selectionEntry"><constraints><constraint id="c-60008" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="c-60009" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></entryLink><entryLink id="el-60010" name="Plasma Torch (alternate weapon choice)" hidden="false" targetId="wpn-30007" type="selectionEntry"><constraints><constraint id="c-60011" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="c-60012" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></entryLink><entryLink id="el-60013" name="Las-beam Cutter (alternate weapon choice)" hidden="false" targetId="wpn-30005" type="selectionEntry"><constraints><constraint id="c-60014" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="c-60015" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="