        <characteristic name="T" typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="W" typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-afc1-b474d8d2b7a8">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="I" typeId="a558b3ef-04d0-440e-a312-bac3255bf592">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="A" typeId="5dff3e7c-e024-4030-a71d-03195ec06ea7">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea">10</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile></profiles>
      <rules><rule id="rule-20329" name="Eye of the Ancestors" hidden="false"><description>Whenever an enemy destroys one of your units or slays a model with the character unit subtype in a challenge, place a Grudge token next to it: up to 3 markers per enemy unit.

Your Leagues of Votann units gain stacking bonuses depending on how many tokens the target enemy unit has:
1- LoV units gain Stubborn when engaged with an enemy unit with a token.
2- LoV units gain Hatred against an enemy unit with 2 tokens.
3- LoV units gain Preferred Enemy against an enemy unit with 3 tokens.

In addition, characters with this rule cannot refuse challenges. If an enemy issues a challenge, a character model with this rule must accept the challenge.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20330" name="Steady Advance" hidden="false"><description>A model/unit entirely composed of models with this rule do not count as having moved while in the shooting phase. Whenever a unit with this rule declares to "Run" in the shooting phase, always move 3".</description></rule><rule id="rule-20331" name="Void Armour" hidden="false"><description>Models with this rule automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, vehicles with this rule count as having Extra Armour.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20332" name="Fearless" hidden="false"><description>This unit has the Fearless special rule.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20333" name="Furious Charge" hidden="false"><description>This unit has the Furious Charge special rule.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20334" name="Feel No Pain (5+)" hidden="false"><description>This unit has the Feel No Pain (5+) special rule.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20335" name="Cyberstimms" hidden="false"><description>When slain in combat, a model with this rule is not removed as a casualty until after it makes its attacks this combat phase. If the model has already attacked when it was slain, then this rule does not take effect.</description></rule></rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <entryLinks>
