        <characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile></profiles>
      <rules><rule id="rule-20277" name="Eye of the Ancestors" hidden="false"><description>Whenever an enemy destroys one of your units or slays a model with the character unit subtype in a challenge, place a Grudge token next to it: up to 3 markers per enemy unit.

Your Leagues of Votann units gain stacking bonuses depending on how many tokens the target enemy unit has:
1- LoV units gain Stubborn when engaged with an enemy unit with a token.
2- LoV units gain Hatred against an enemy unit with 2 tokens.
3- LoV units gain Preferred Enemy against an enemy unit with 3 tokens.

In addition, characters with this rule cannot refuse challenges. If an enemy issues a challenge, a character model with this rule must accept the challenge.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20278" name="Steady Advance" hidden="false"><description>A model/unit entirely composed of models with this rule do not count as having moved while in the shooting phase. Whenever a unit with this rule declares to "Run" in the shooting phase, always move 3".</description></rule><rule id="rule-20279" name="Void Armour" hidden="false"><description>Models with this rule automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, vehicles with this rule count as having Extra Armour.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20280" name="Infiltrate" hidden="false"><description>This unit has the Infiltrate special rule.</description></rule><rule id="rule-20281" name="Move Through Cover" hidden="false"><description>This unit has the Move Through Cover special rule.</description></rule></rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="12" /></costs>
