          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="287c-133b-9698-4052" name="Computational Mastermind" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per Command phase, for each objective marker you control that has one or more models with this ability within range of it, you may either place a Grudge token on one enemy unit, or remove one Grudge token from an enemy unit.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="70ab-fd02-8993-4470" name="Predictive Guidance" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per battle round, this unit may make a charge move as if it had declared a charge this turn, even though it did not.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="f50b-5d6d-b2c6-8fe2" name="Leader" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can be attached to the following units: Ironkin Steeljacks with Heavy Volkanite Disintegrators, Ironkin Steeljacks with Melee Weapons</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="f790-5f8d-0a03-4197" name="Guerrilla Adepts" hidden="false">
          <description>In your Shooting phase, just after this unit is selected to shoot, you may select one enemy unit. Until the end of the phase, this unit's attacks can only target that unit. If one or more of those attacks hit, until the start of your next Shooting phase that enemy unit suffers -2" Move and -1 to its hit rolls.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <categoryLinks>
