          <description>While this model is within 3" of one or more other friendly Leagues of Votann Infantry units (excluding units with the Lone Operative special rule), this model has the Lone Operative special rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="c9fa-f157-85ea-7edd" name="Resource Transmutation" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per turn, in your Shooting phase, this model can use this ability when it is selected to shoot. If it does, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by this model have the Deflagrate special rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="74c6-8c83-40cc-8334" name="Deadly Demise" hidden="false">
          <description>This model follows the standard Vehicle Damage rules for explosions when destroyed - no additional effect.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="dfab-757e-df26-61ed" name="Guerrilla Adepts" hidden="false">
          <description>In your Shooting phase, just after this unit is selected to shoot, you may select one enemy unit. Until the end of the phase, this unit's attacks can only target that unit. If one or more of those attacks hit, until the start of your next Shooting phase that enemy unit suffers -2" Move and -1 to its hit rolls.</description>
